---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = "August 23, 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - Easy Calorie Calculator"
  description="Read our privacy policy to understand how Easy Calorie Calculator collects, uses, and protects your personal information."
>
  <Header />

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-canvas py-12 md:py-16 border-b border-hairline">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(at_30%_20%,rgba(80,227,194,0.05)_0px,transparent_50%),radial-gradient(at_70%_20%,rgba(121,40,202,0.04)_0px,transparent_50%)] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 text-center relative z-10 space-y-4">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-caption-mono text-xs text-body bg-canvas-soft-2 border border-hairline px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
        Legal
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink font-display-lg max-w-xl mx-auto leading-none">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-body max-w-lg mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Your privacy matters. Here's exactly how we handle your information.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs text-mute font-caption-mono">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="w-full py-12 md:py-16 bg-canvas-soft">
    <div class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 space-y-10">

      <div class="bg-canvas rounded-xl border border-hairline p-6 md:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-level-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink font-display-sm">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
          Easy Calorie Calculator is designed to be privacy-first. We do <strong class="text-ink">not</strong> create accounts, store your personal health data on our servers, or require any registration to use our tools.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
          The calculator inputs you provide (age, weight, height, activity level, goals) are processed entirely in your browser and are never transmitted to or stored on our servers.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-2 mt-2">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">We may automatically collect:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-body">
            <li><strong class="text-ink">Usage data:</strong> Pages visited, time spent, browser type, device type, and general geographic region (country/city level) via analytics.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-ink">Log data:</strong> IP address, referrer URL, and timestamps — standard server log data retained for security and abuse prevention.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-ink">Cookies & local storage:</strong> We use local storage to save your theme preference (light/dark mode). No tracking cookies are set by us directly.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-canvas rounded-xl border border-hairline p-6 md:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-level-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink font-display-sm">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-body">
          <li>To operate, maintain, and improve our calculator tools.</li>
          <li>To analyze aggregate usage patterns and optimize page performance.</li>
          <li>To detect and prevent fraud, abuse, or security threats.</li>
          <li>To comply with applicable laws and regulations.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm text-body leading-relaxed mt-2">
          We do <strong class="text-ink">not</strong> sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-canvas rounded-xl border border-hairline p-6 md:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-level-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink font-display-sm">3. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
          We may use third-party services that have their own privacy policies. These include:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-body">
          <li><strong class="text-ink">Google Fonts:</strong> Used to serve typefaces. Google may collect anonymized usage data.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ink">Analytics providers:</strong> We may use privacy-respecting analytics (e.g., aggregated, anonymized data only) to understand site traffic.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ink">Hosting providers:</strong> Our infrastructure provider may log standard server access data.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-canvas rounded-xl border border-hairline p-6 md:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-level-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink font-display-sm">4. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
          We use browser <strong class="text-ink">local storage</strong> (not traditional cookies) to remember your theme preference. This data stays on your device and is not transmitted to us. You can clear it at any time through your browser's developer tools or settings.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-canvas rounded-xl border border-hairline p-6 md:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-level-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink font-display-sm">5. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
          Our services are not directed at children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us and we will delete it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-canvas rounded-xl border border-hairline p-6 md:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-level-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink font-display-sm">6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
          Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete any personal data we hold about you. Since we collect minimal data, most requests can be addressed by simply clearing your browser's local storage. For any other inquiries, please contact us at the details below.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-canvas rounded-xl border border-hairline p-6 md:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-level-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink font-display-sm">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-canvas rounded-xl border border-hairline p-6 md:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-level-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink font-display-sm">8. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please reach out via our <a href="/contact" class="text-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity">Contact Us</a> page.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
